From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 06:06:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Initialize functions and post-processings of batches

For the behaviours generated by the generic-parallel interface, the
initialize functions and the post-processings are executed on the points
of a material data manager as a batch, with the execution policy of the
manager: the functions of a material data manager, with or without thread
pool, switch to the batch functions. A failure is reported with the index
of the first point where it occurred, and invalid arguments and errors of
the backend by exceptions.

The construction of the view on the points of a manager and the conversion
of the output status are shared with the integration.

GenericParallelIntegrateTest compares the initialize functions (inputs
given point by point and uniform, no input, range of points) and a
post-processing with the ones of the generic interface.
